   "commit": {
    "message": "deps(actions): bump the github-actions group with 4 updates\n\nBumps the github-actions group with 4 updates: [bencherdev/bencher](https://github.com/bencherdev/bencher), [actions/setup-go](https://github.com/actions/setup-go), [sigstore/cosign-installer](https://github.com/sigstore/cosign-installer) and [actions/setup-node](https://github.com/actions/setup-node).\n\n\nUpdates `bencherdev/bencher` from 0.6.12 to 0.6.17\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/bencherdev/bencher/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/bencherdev/bencher/compare/v0.6.12...v0.6.17)\n\nUpdates `actions/setup-go` from 6 to 7\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/actions/setup-go/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/actions/setup-go/compare/v6...v7)\n\nUpdates `sigstore/cosign-installer` from 4.1.2 to 4.1.3\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/sigstore/cosign-installer/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/sigstore/cosign-installer/compare/v4.1.2...v4.1.3)\n\nUpdates `actions/setup-node` from 6 to 7\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/actions/setup-node/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/actions/setup-node/compare/v6...v7)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: bencherdev/bencher\n  dependency-version: 0.6.17\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n  dependency-group: github-actions\n- dependency-name: actions/setup-go\n  dependency-version: '7'\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-major\n  dependency-group: github-actions\n- dependency-name: sigstore/cosign-installer\n  dependency-version: 4.1.3\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n  dependency-group: github-actions\n- dependency-name: actions/setup-node\n  dependency-version: '7'\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-major\n  dependency-group: github-actions\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>",
